	(fp_text user "Module underside sits ~8.5 mm above the carrier; the inter-row corridor is 15.24 - 1.80 = 13.44 mm. Anything placed under the module must be <=7 mm tall and solderable before the headers are fitted. Prefer GND pour and routing only."
